Change log
v3.2
Fixed: Refresh failed with "object is not iterable" and lost which branches were open.
v3.1
Fixed: Rhino could close when you renamed a row or used the Show checkbox. Tree refreshes now run after the edit finishes.
Every handler now catches its own errors and reports them on the Rhino command line as "Outliner error".
v3
Added Show checkbox column for hide/show of objects and layer on/off.
Added right-click menu: Hide, Show, Isolate, Unisolate, Show all hidden objects.
Added multi-select.
v2
Added rename in place for objects and layers, with undo.
Layers now show as a nested tree.
Added Info and Type columns.
v1
First release: layer list with objects, click to select and zoom.
